Name: core-js
Short Name: core-js
URL: https://github.com/zloirock/core-js
Version: 3.50.0
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Polyfills for JavaScript features that Chromium 116 lacks, injected into every
web page by FlyWeb (renderer/flyweb/flyweb_polyfills_render_frame_observer.cc).

Local Modifications:
flyweb_polyfills.js is a minified bundle generated with core-js-builder by
FlyWeb/polyfills/build.mjs in https://github.com/lamosquita-net/softmac.
Do not edit by hand.
